    },
    {
      "_key": "7b06331ebc57",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "51f5c7450d5d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b08c99733ca1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b25914806ced",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Can I reapply after a student visa rejection?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3f5ea0c1b62f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "514decc83078",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\nYes, in most cases, you can reapply. However, it’s essential to understand the specific reason for the rejection and address it before submitting a new application."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "91b06b300734",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bd81a1aea1fd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "How long should I wait before reapplying?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ff610aa68462",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e7edf6a53bf2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "39bc83e164ce",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " This depends on the country and the reason for rejection. In some cases, you can reapply immediately; in others, you may need to wait a specified period. Consulting an education expert is strongly recommended before reapplying."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4572fd728e69",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "443c299ad4cc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Does a student visa rejection affect future visa applications?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "326db14e5ca3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4716e99dcaaa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\nA rejection itself doesn’t automatically disqualify you from future applications, but you must disclose it. Failing to disclose prior rejections can have serious consequences."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "252336059e54",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a01de0601cc8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "How can Admizz Education help with my visa application?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e914ba73238e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c3c835d0ebec",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\nAdmizz Education provides end-to-end support — including course selection, university applications, SOP writing, document preparation, and visa application guidance — to maximize your chances of success."
        }
      ],
